      "releaseNotes": "Hexis on Apple Watch. Morning and evening on your wrist: one question at a time, answered by speaking, and saved to the same journal as your iPhone, iPad and Mac.\n\nStill one payment, still no AI, no streaks, and no nudges.",
      "version": "1.4.0",
      "wrapperType": "software",
      "currency": "GBP",
      "description": "Hexis is a guided journal for mornings and evenings. Open a notebook, pick a morning or evening practice, and write an entry. Export it as text, Markdown, or PDF, any time. No account or sign-in needed. A one-time $4.99 purchase, no subscription and no in-app purchases.\n\nThe value of a journal isn't the data it stores. It's the thinking it provokes, and who that thinking slowly makes you. So Hexis does less, on purpose, and gets out of your way.\n\nTWO MOMENTS, PRACTISED DAILY\nMorning: name what matters, what may test you, and what's within your control.\nEvening: what held, what slipped, and what you'll carry forward. Without judgement.\n\nSEVEN NOTEBOOKS, EACH A PURPOSE\nMorning, Evening, Virtues, Free Writing, Decisions, Hard Seasons, and Homework for Life. Well-crafted questions drawn from long-practised reflection. Begin where you need to, and the page does the rest.\n\nJUST YOU AND THE PAGE\nOpen a practice and the cursor is already waiting. A serif tuned for reading, wide margins, a single uncluttered column. Keep the questions beside you, or tuck them away. No toolbars, no formatting, no counters demanding attention. Type freely on any device, and on iPad write by hand with Apple Pencil.\n\nACROSS YOUR DEVICES\nBegin a page on your iPhone at dawn; open your iPad that evening and it's waiting, every word in place. Private iCloud sync carries your journal between iPhone, iPad, and Mac, and never to us. And you can lock the whole journal behind Face ID or Touch ID, so it opens for you and no one else, even when the device is already unlocked and handed across the table.\n\nA SHORT LIST OF NEVERS\nNo AI. Your thoughts, not a model's. Left out on purpose.\nNo subscription. Bought once, yours for good.\nNo streaks, badges, or games to win.\nNo dashboards. A journal, not a quantified self.\nNo tracking. Nothing reads your entries.\nOne gentle reminder, and only if you ask.\n\nYOURS, FOR GOOD\nLocal-first: your entries are stored as plain Markdown, yours to keep.\nExport everything as plain text, Markdown, or PDF, any time. No lock-in.\nNo account. No email, no sign-up. Open it and write.\n\nPRICING\n$4.99 once on the App Store. The whole app, nothing held back. No subscription, no in-app purchases, ever. One purchase covers iPhone, iPad, and Mac.\n\nHexis: the steady disposition formed by repeated practice. Built to get out of your way.",
